      "anchor_sha256": "efec31bc7bc0179046c21250a0fd40f6618ff9b32ab4b7c9a3a321b11e2338c3",
      "detail_en": "Calibration produced 46/64 placements, with 63 docks and 62 qualified lifts. N0 anchored the task at 0.625. Full credit requires 9/16 strict placements (90% of the anchor) and a passing observation-response check. Fresh panels achieved 11/16 placements (6/8 boxes, 5/8 cylinders) then 12/16 placements (6/8 boxes, 6/8 cylinders).",
      "detail_zh": "校准组共 46/64 次严格放置，63 次稳定停靠，62 次承重抬起。N0 基准为 0.625。满分需达到 9/16 次严格放置（基准的 90%）并通过观测响应检查。新分配两组分别为11/16 个严格放置（箱子 6/8、圆柱 5/8）；12/16 个严格放置（箱子 6/8、圆柱 6/8）。",
      "stages_en": "Across 32 confirmation starts, 32 qualified the walk, 32 docked, 32 qualified a lift and 23 placed the object. There were 9 time limits, 0 approach disqualifications, 0 falls and 0 program aborts. Alternative observations changed 236/256 responses, identical repeats 0/32.",
      "stages_zh": "32 个确认起点中，32 个行走达标、32 个停靠、32 个承重抬起、23 个稳定放置。共 9 个超时、0 个接近违规、0 个跌倒、0 个程序中止。替代观测有 236/256 次响应变化，相同输入重复为 0/32。",
